PyDoc_STRVAR(__pyx_doc_6classy_7_classy_5Class_142get_qcdm_fast_pkpoles, "\n        Re-evaluate the exact-QS c-c\047 tracer multipoles at fixed cosmology.\n\n        This is the fast path intended for DESI nuisance-parameter sampling:\n        the background, linear perturbations, Fourier spectra, and exact\n        F_n/G_n kernel ODEs are *not* recomputed.  The method reuses the\n        kernels cached by the most recent nonlinear_pt_init call and only\n        rebuilds the exact Z1/Z2/Z3 tracer contractions, EFT/stochastic\n        pieces, AP map, and ell=0,2,4 projection.\n\n        Parameters\n        ----------\n        k_h : array_like\n            Wavenumbers in h/Mpc.\n        z : float\n            Must be one of the z_pk values used in the CLASS computation.\n        params : mapping or length-24 array_like\n            If a mapping is supplied it must contain the following keys, in\n            the exact two-fluid tracer convention used by nonlinear_pt.c:\n            qcdm_tf_b_m, qcdm_tf_b_r, qcdm_tf_b_theta_r,\n            qcdm_tf_c_vr, qcdm_tf_c_mr, qcdm_tf_c_K,\n            qcdm_tf_b_mm, qcdm_tf_b_mr, qcdm_tf_b_rr,\n            qcdm_tf_b_Gmm, qcdm_tf_b_Gmr, qcdm_tf_b_Grr,\n            qcdm_tf_b_Gamma3,\n            qcdm_tf_ct0, qcdm_tf_ct2, qcdm_tf_ct4,\n            qcdm_tf_ct_r0, qcdm_tf_ct_r2, qcdm_tf_ct_r4,\n            qcdm_tf_stoch0, qcdm_tf_stoch2, qcdm_tf_stoch2_mu2,\n            qcdm_fNL_equilateral, qcdm_fNL_orthogonal.\n        hratio, Dratio : float, optional\n            External Alcock--Paczynski ratios. If both are supplied they\n            override the ratios cached from CLASS\047 ``Omfid`` approximation.\n            The convention is ``hratio = H_true/H_fid = 1/q_parallel`` and\n            ``Dratio = D_M,true/D_M,fid = q_perp``. This is intended for the\n            DESI bridge, which supplies the exact DESI fiducial ratios.\n\n        Returns\n        -------\n        ndarray, shape (3, len(k_h))\n            P0, P2, P4 in (Mpc/h)^3.\n        ");
